editor_description = "The high altar (tools/build/prop_abbey_church.py): a stone mensa, 2 x 1 m and 1 m high, on a stone back; open under it behind a dark frontal that hangs round its front (-Z) and ends to a hand above the floor (a hiding spot: he looks out under the hem). A linen over the top, two prickets with unlit tapers, a plain oak cross. The priest stands at -Z. The hidden Blocks are its collision; the cloth's is not solid."

